.png", "id": "920856615987670", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75289916_920856619321003_1167628786352568211_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=smllXBARu20Q7kNvwFV5muw&_nc_oc=AdncEptBDHwbkH8hCc8FtVL7Fo07eRt3fIrmlNRwylSv8ED0f-9mWA35aqjjtMwyjnA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afwc9aTo0o_-QuHF5H4dMtvZLe3AZrh-GQlMSPJ_UU2_ew&oe=69B40D98"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 5_2560_1440.png", "id": "727856879468758", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974812_727856882802091_1641997799950234504_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=k7C3dUaCfbQQ7kNvwEfJ-Q0&_nc_oc=AdnrbIQGgVSktO4GUR0qmTLFoxLyN-8IUE1VeuLsCuMAxuhAQtallcJf-oa431OiGcA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwTOuzd1nYoI8EYil9apWNDd7ORJLzeijkOtmqtsAiacw&oe=69B40AC0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverArt_Galateum_CoverLandscape.png", "id": "684438640283334", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974677_684438646950000_5562717609088558112_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=evPBV7kp-9IQ7kNvwGsMzMr&_nc_oc=AdmhDGtXInGeW3MaioMXYL3kk1sfVKuu3ulhaNolaiY3v_yGAa7pTRpcp80jYfzcA7U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyeyApDg0K-SRjZtAFoSJH9GiY-Tt8lKuPOzOC_XNtL0A&oe=69B40AF3"}, "display_name": "Galateum", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Immerse yourself in our unique FPS experience, combining cyberpunk aesthetics with the merciless conditions of a desert planet. Navigate neon-lit buildings and desolate vistas, outmoving and outplaying your opponents.\nCombat isn't just about force - it's about strategy and adaptation. Leverage the jet-pack to traverse the environment, using the map's entire verticality, while engaging in intense gun fights.\nYour cyberpunk survival odyssey starts here.\n\n", "short_description": "Dive into a unique FPS experience on a harsh desert planet. Challenge yourself and other p